<view class="page tt-page cfg-page" wx:if="{{config}}">
  <view class="tt-section">
    <text>北斗运动（激励视频）</text>
    <text class="tt-section-extra">看完广告四项一起入账</text>
  </view>

  <view class="tt-card cfg-card">
    <view class="cfg-fitem cfg-fitem-switch">
      <view class="cfg-flabel-col">
        <text class="cfg-switch-label">启用</text>
        <text class="cfg-fdesc">关闭后用户端隐藏北斗运动入口</text>
      </view>
      <t-switch value="{{config.rewardVideo.enabled}}" bind:change="onReward" data-field="enabled" />
    </view>

    <view class="cfg-fitem">
      <text class="cfg-flabel">每日观看上限（次）</text>
      <input class="cfg-input" type="number" value="{{config.rewardVideo.dailyLimit}}" bindinput="onReward" data-field="dailyLimit" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tt-section">
    <text>每次观看奖励</text>
    <text class="tt-section-extra">四项同时写入当日运动记录</text>
  </view>

  <view class="tt-card cfg-card">
    <view class="cfg-fitem">
      <view class="rv-flabel">
        <text class="rv-flabel-title">步数（步）</text>
        <text class="cfg-fdesc">整数 ≥ 0</text>
      </view>
      <input class="cfg-input" type="number" value="{{config.rewardVideo.stepsPerWatch}}" bindinput="onReward" data-field="stepsPerWatch" />
    </view>

    <view class="cfg-fitem">
      <view class="rv-flabel">
        <text class="rv-flabel-title">距离（米）</text>
        <text class="cfg-fdesc">留空按步数换算 · 当前生效 {{config.rewardVideoEffective.distance}} 米</text>
      </view>
      <input
        class="cfg-input"
        type="digit"
        value="{{config.rewardVideo.distancePerWatch}}"
        placeholder="按步数换算"
        bindinput="onReward"
        data-field="distancePerWatch"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="cfg-fitem">
      <view class="rv-flabel">
        <text class="rv-flabel-title">卡路里（千卡）</text>
        <text class="cfg-fdesc">留空按步数换算 · 当前生效 {{config.rewardVideoEffective.calories}} 千卡</text>
      </view>
      <input
        class="cfg-input"
        type="number"
        value="{{config.rewardVideo.caloriesPerWatch}}"
        placeholder="按步数换算"
        bindinput="onReward"
        data-field="caloriesPerWatch"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="cfg-fitem">
      <view class="rv-flabel">
        <text class="rv-flabel-title">时长（秒）</text>
        <text class="cfg-fdesc">留空按步数换算 · 当前生效 {{config.rewardVideoEffective.durationSeconds}} 秒</text>
      </view>
      <input
        class="cfg-input"
        type="number"
        value="{{config.rewardVideo.durationPerWatch}}"
        placeholder="按步数换算"
        bindinput="onReward"
        data-field="durationPerWatch"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="rv-fnote">
      距离/卡路里/时长留空时，按项目既有的「步数 → 距离/卡路里/时长」换算（0.7 米/步、0.04 千卡/步、0.5 秒/步）派生；
      填写后即以填写值为准。用户端展示与实际入账都取这里的生效值。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tt-section">
    <text>广告位</text>
    <text class="tt-section-extra">客户端公开标识，可留空</text>
  </view>

  <view class="tt-card cfg-card">
    <view class="cfg-fitem">
      <view class="rv-flabel">
        <text class="rv-flabel-title">激励视频广告位 ID</text>
        <text class="cfg-fdesc">留空用客户端内置默认广告位</text>
      </view>
      <input
        class="cfg-input"
        type="text"
        value="{{config.rewardVideo.adUnitId}}"
        placeholder="默认广告位"
        bindinput="onRewardText"
        data-field="adUnitId"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="cfg-save-bar">
    <t-button theme="primary" block loading="{{saving}}" bind:tap="save">保存配置</t-button>
  </view>

  <view class="tt-footer">配置修改后立即对用户端生效（含每次可获得与入账值）</view>
</view>
